        },
        {
          "id": "script-ppt20260930-fuping-p015-s3-t2",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "程福涓：（摇头）不，你不是的。",
          "role": "程福涓",
          "color": "#18605A",
          "source_page": 15,
          "source_file": "示例内容源-A-更新版-2026-09-30.pptx",
